## Vision: A Professional Quant Research Platform

If executed well, your application will no longer resemble a retail trading bot. It will resemble the workflow used by quantitative research teams: a strategy is conceived in the **Research Lab**, rigorously validated in the **Backtesting Lab**, proven under realistic market conditions in the **Paper Trading Lab**, and only then promoted to the **Live Trading Lab**. Every promotion is backed by measurable evidence—performance metrics, risk analysis, and AI-generated review reports—creating a disciplined research-to-production pipeline. That architecture is what will differentiate your platform from most AI trading applications.
